  "prefLabel": "Jus 1407.05 Interstate Advertising",
  "priorExpiration": "2019-04-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1407.05 Interstate Advertising. A condominium which is not located in this state and is not registered in this state, and which might be advertised in out-of-state publications disseminated in this state or through an out-of-state medium received in this state, shall comply with Jus 1407.04 only if the offer originates within this state or is directed by the offeror to a person within this state.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Jus 1400) #9783-A, eff 9-11-10, EXPIRED: 9-11-18\n\nNew. #12657, INTERIM, eff 11-1-18, EXPIRED: 4-30-19\n\nNew. #12910, eff 10-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus1400.html"
